{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/banker_wish.png?t=1741457132\" /><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1741457132\" /><strong><br>Banker Simulator Demo</strong>, is a limited version of the full game and offers the perfect opportunity to start rescuing a bank on the brink of bankruptcy. Conduct financial analyses, make investment decisions, and rebuild your bank with critical strategic moves. In this single-player simulation game, test your strategic thinking and management skills as you work to bring your bank back to the top! <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/moneymachine__1_.gif?t=1741457132\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALISTIC MONEY PRINTING SYSTEM:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big rewards come with big risks! Expand your bank\u2019s influence by printing counterfeit money and laundering it without getting caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/print.gif?t=1741457132\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ID VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every client is trustworthy! Conduct identity checks, detect fake documents, and safeguard your bank\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/ezgif-1-b1394bee85__1_.gif?t=1741457132\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE THE HIGH LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST, AND RISE TO THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banking is just the beginning! Use your wealth to enjoy a luxurious lifestyle, invest in profitable ventures, and establish your status. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A successful bank is built on trust! Offer top-tier financial services, negotiate deals, and maintain a loyal client base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASH HANDLING &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage large amounts of cash and ensure seamless banking transactions. Every bill counts!<strong><br>Differences Between a Demo and a Prologue:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed Money Printing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced Bank Teller Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bank Robbery Scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various NPC Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Identity Verification Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable Bank Transaction Fees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machine Maintenance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ATM Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle Layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bank Customization </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>''Banker Simulator''</strong>\u00a0Add To Your Wishlist! <br><br>Every strategic decision you make will shape the future of your bank. Get ready to manage financial crises, make profitable investments, and overcome challenging economic scenarios. In this immersive world, analytical thinking and careful planning will lead your bank to success!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468480?t=1741457132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741457132","capsule_image":"https://sha