.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/print.gif?t=1741457132\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ID VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every client is trustworthy! Conduct identity checks, detect fake documents, and safeguard your bank\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/extras/ezgif-1-b1394bee85__1_.gif?t=1741457132\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE THE HIGH LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST, AND RISE TO THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banking is just the beginning! Use your wealth to enjoy a luxurious lifestyle, invest in profitable ventures, and establish your status. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A successful bank is built on trust! Offer top-tier financial services, negotiate deals, and maintain a loyal client base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASH HANDLING &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage large amounts of cash and ensure seamless banking transactions. Every bill counts!<strong><br>Differences Between a Demo and a Prologue:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed Money Printing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced Bank Teller Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bank Robbery Scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various NPC Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Identity Verification Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable Bank Transaction Fees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machine Maintenance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ATM Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle Layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bank Customization </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>''Banker Simulator''</strong>\u00a0Add To Your Wishlist! <br><br>Every strategic decision you make will shape the future of your bank. Get ready to manage financial crises, make profitable investments, and overcome challenging economic scenarios. In this immersive world, analytical thinking and careful planning will lead your bank to success!</p>","developers":["Soi Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3393240","name":"Banker Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468480/header.jpg?t=1741457132","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098568,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098568/movie480.mp4?t=1740233692","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098568/movie_max.mp4?t=1740233692"},"name":"Gameplay Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098568/88975957f250800c18ac990dfce2574617f49319/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740233692","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098568/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740233692","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098568/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740233692"}}],"name":"Banker Simulator Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX 4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>